---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="bg" page="home" title="BentoConsult — Проектиране на бизнеса преди ERP" description="Първо проектираме бизнес системата, в която ERP е отражение, а не решение на проблеми.">
<section class="relative overflow-hidden"> <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-navy via-navy to-graphite"></div> <div class="absolute top-1/4 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div> <div class="section-container relative py-20 lg:py-28"> <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"> <div> <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight">Проектиране на бизнеса преди ERP</h1> <p class="mt-6 text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-lg whitespace-pre-line">Ние не внедряваме ERP.
Първо проектираме бизнес системата,
в която ERP е отражение, а не решение на проблеми.</p> <div class="mt-8"> <a href="/bg/contacts" class="btn-primary">Обсъди проект</a> </div> </div> <div class="relative flex justify-center"> <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-glow-lg bg-graphite max-w-[280px] lg:max-w-[320px]"> <img src="/images/owner-portrait.webp" alt="Karen Arutyunyan — BentoConsult" class="w-full h-auto object-contain" width="585" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-navy/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div>
</section>
<section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-graphite/20"> <div class="section-container max-w-3xl mx-auto"> <h2 class="section-title text-center mb-12">Философия за ERP</h2> <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"> <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-navy/60 p-8 border-l-4 border-l-cyan"> <p class="text-lg text-gray-200 whitespace-pre-line leading-relaxed">ERP не решава проблемите на бизнеса.
Той ги показва.</p> </div> <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-navy/60 p-8 border-l-4 border-l-cyan"> <p class="text-lg text-gray-200 whitespace-pre-line leading-relaxed">Автоматизация без архитектура
ускорява хаоса, а не ефективността.</p> </div> </div> </div>
</section>
<section class="py-16 lg:py-20"> <div class="section-container max-w-3xl mx-auto"> <h2 class="section-title text-center mb-12">Как изграждаме системи</h2> <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"> <div class="card flex items-center gap-4"> <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 flex items-center justify-center"> <span class="text-sm font-bold text-cyan">01</span> </div> <span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Анализ на икономическата дейност</span> </div><div class="card flex items-center gap-4"> <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 flex items-center justify-center"> <span class="text-sm font-bold text-cyan">02</span> </div> <span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Проектиране на архитектура</span> </div><div class="card flex items-center gap-4"> <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 flex items-center justify-center"> <span class="text-sm font-bold text-cyan">03</span> </div> <span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Избор на ERP</span> </div><div class="card flex items-center gap-4"> <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 flex items-center justify-center"> <span class="text-sm font-bold text-cyan">04</span> </div> <span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Контрол на внедряването</span> </div> </div> </div>
</section>
</Layout>
